WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.069
Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.203
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.371
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.406
After a clip
was released yesterday

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.942
of former President Trump
storming out of an interview

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:11.911
with journalist Piers Morgan,

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:15.014
a spokesman for Trump
called the preview a

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:17.583
"pathetic attempt
to revive the career

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.119
of a failed television host."

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.788
Buddy, you're gonna
have to be more specific.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.656
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.525
That's right --
Piers Morgan released a clip

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.426
from an interview
with former President Trump

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:28.628
that he claims will be

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.563
"the most explosive interview
of the year."

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.199
Well, it's certainly
gonna be the sweatiest!

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.234
I mean, look --
He looks like Jigsaw

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.404
just told him he has an hour
to name all the state capitals.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.439
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:43.376
After the Capitol attack,
Senate Majority Leader --

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.244
Sorry -- Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:47.680
reportedly told --
he was the majority at the time.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.381
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.318
No, he wasn't. Was he?

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.320
After January 6th, was he?

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:56.856
-Yeah. Before, right?

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.658
-Yeah, but on January -- Oh, no,
he wasn't. You know what?

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:01.394
I think the important thing
right now

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.696
is that this is good television.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.599
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.868
Nobody's gonna argue that.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.737
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:13.473
After the Capitol attack,

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.241
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.377
reportedly told his advisers
that he thought

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.179
former President Trump was
responsible for the insurrection

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:22.114
and added, "
The Democrats are going to

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.450
take care of
the son of a bitch for us."

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.852
Oh, come on, Mitch. You've been
around politics for a long time.

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.355
When have the Democrats
ever taken care of anything?

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.924
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.826
Rudy Giuliani appeared on --

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.361
Oh, I'm sorry
you had to find out here.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:39.465
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:42.836
Rudy Giuliani appeared on
"The Masked Singer" last night

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:45.004
in a jack-in-the-box costume

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.839
and sang the song
"Bad to the Bone."

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.808
I mean,
that is just unbelievable.

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:52.445
Somebody famous
was on "The Masked Singer"!

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:54.447
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.683
The new CNN Plus
streaming service

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:59.285
is reportedly shutting down
on April 30th

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.353
after launching
less than a month ago.

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:02.722
Well, I'm not surprised.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.958
You already have
a 24-hour news channel,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:08.628
and you couldn't even
fill that with news.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.997
Don't get me wrong.
I'd watch Tucci go anywhere.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:14.300
The Trump International Hotel
in Washington, D.C.,

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.069
is set to be sold
in the coming days

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:18.170
to a Florida-based
investor group

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.573
led by this intriguing
mystery man.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:24.110
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.647
Disney World on Tuesday lifted
its remaining mask requirements,

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:31.317
and it is really
freaking out the kids.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.586
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.254
[ Applause ]

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:37.824
Tyranny's over!

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.926
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.061
The organizers
of the Tony Awards

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.263
have issued a warning
to attendees

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:48.067
that this year's ceremony has
a "strict no-violence policy,"

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.035
which is obviously a response

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:53.573
to that time that guy shot
Alexander Hamilton.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.875
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.476 --> 00:03:01.781
People love "Hamilton" so much,
they were, like, "Yeah!"

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:03.783
A man in Canada
recently discovered

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:06.251
through a DNA test
that his biological father

00:03:06.251 --> 00:03:07.853
was his former co-worker,

00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:10.557
though he probably should have
figured it out sooner.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:14.160
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.399
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.235
Just, I like when
I have to wait a second

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:23.770
'cause it's a reading joke.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:27.273
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.141
Today was National Tea Day.

00:03:29.141 --> 00:03:31.443
Oh, do you guys want some tea?
In that case...

00:03:31.443 --> 00:03:33.947
[Whispering]
Wally's getting fired later.

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.181
-Hey!

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.749
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.117
-I'm kidding.

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.751
I went to the network brass
and I said,

00:03:39.751 --> 00:03:40.953
"Either he goes or I go!"

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:43.689
And they're like,
"Have a great day."

00:03:43.689 --> 00:03:45.825
And finally,
according to the latest numbers,

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.960
by this summer,
Netflix is projected to lose

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.462
around 2 million subscribers.

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:52.331
To combat this, they're tweaking
the app a little.

00:03:52.331 --> 00:03:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.769
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

